msgid "Position centred on the start edge."
msgstr "시작(edge) 가장자리에 중심을 맞춘 위치."

#: css/badge.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Position at the top-end corner."
msgstr "상단-끝(corner) 위치."

#: css/badge.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Position at the top-start corner."
msgstr "상단-시작(corner) 위치."

#: css/badge.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A pulsing attention ring."
msgstr "펄스(맥박)하는 주목 링."

#: css/badge.md
